<title>FINLAND: CITYCON 8-MTH PROFIT RISES TO FIM 1.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>CITYCON 8-MTH PROFIT RISES TO FIM 1.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items, tax 1.7 vs 1.6</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	     0.06 vs 0.05</p>
<p> Net sales				     24.3 vs 24.4</p>
<p> Operating profit			    12.7 vs 13.3</p>
<p> Net profit				     1.7 vs 1.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish real estate investment company</p>
<p>is Kiinteistosijoitus Oy Citycon.</p>
